						<name>Outlaw-Ethics</name>
						<adjective>ethical</adjective>
						<memberName>Ethicist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Top Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Top Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"In my daily visitations with the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;squirrel&lt;/color&gt;s I learned to truly listen to them. Over and over, in their own way, they repeated their message to me: What you can't defend doesn't belong to you. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Reflections by a Muffalo-Herder&lt;/i&gt; by Artemisia 'Arty' Thrip</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"In my daily visitations with the %%animal0_thingDef_label%%s I learned to truly listen to them. Over and over, in their own way, they repeated their message to me: What you can't defend doesn't belong to you. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

